<title>ISRAEL: Industrial Buildings Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Industrial Buildings Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Industrial Buildings Ltd.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			   Q3 96	Q3 95	9-MTH 96     9-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		  44,854     39,843     129,216	114,622</p>
<p>Operating profit     26,153     22,389	72,891	 64,122</p>
<p>Net Profit	     11,028     14,434	34,285	 36,856</p>
<p>($1 = 3.25 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
